<p class="docs-kicker">WELCOME TO AURORA</p>
<h2>New to Aurora? Start here.</h2>
<p>Aurora is a project to build an operating system and a web browser. You do not need to be a programmer to understand what we are building or follow its progress.</p>

<h2>What is Aurora?</h2>
<p><strong>Aurora OS</strong> is the operating system. It is being built from scratch in Rust. The goal is to make it reliable, private and secure by default, while allowing people to choose how their computer is set up.</p>
<p><strong>Lumen</strong> is the web browser being developed as part of the Aurora project. It is a separate application from the operating system.</p>

<div class="docs-callout">
  <strong>Can I install Aurora on my computer today?</strong>
  <p>Not yet. There is currently no verified public installer or tested installation guide. Aurora OS is still in development. Please do not download or install unofficial files claiming to be an Aurora release.</p>
  <p><a href="/en/downloads/">Go to the official Downloads page</a> to check availability.</p>
</div>

