<h2>When an installer is available</h2>
<p>The official download page will include a step-by-step guide written for people who have never installed an operating system before. It will explain how to check whether your computer is supported, prepare an installation USB drive, protect your existing files, install Aurora and recover if something goes wrong.</p>
<p>We will publish those steps only after they have been tested with the release they describe. Until then, the safest choice is to wait for an official release.</p>
